WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.780
The board

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:19.970
Hand out two jobs at once

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:27.100
Two agents working in parallel

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:32.360
Verified done - the check is the receipt

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:37.410
Land the merge

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:44.470
One agent says it's done. It isn't.

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:50.000
The check catches it
